+
+**Pitfalls:**
+*   Invisible Gaussians (`radii <= 0`) must be skipped during key/value generation to avoid emitting invalid or zero-sized tile overlaps [S1, unofficial].
+*   Tile range boundaries must correctly handle the first and last elements of the sorted list to ensure all tiles have valid start/end indices [S1, unofficial].
+*   Input `cov2d` must have a shape ending in 3 (upper triangular values). An assertion error is raised if this condition is not met [S2, unofficial].
+*   The mapping functions are not differentiable to any input. Gradients must be handled separately or these steps excluded from the differentiable graph [S2, unofficial].
 
